Canonical source ownership
==========================

EmberBSD-Ports owns the common headers and libelf implementation.
See libelf.md for the prepared snapshot and validation contract.
Do not import these components into dist or patch the generated snapshot.

The dist/libdwarf implementation retains its separate BSD import history.
Use dist/tools/netbsd-base-system-import.sh with -m libdwarf when preparing
an upstream update. Review the selected revision and preserve its authorship.
The build uses common headers from the validated libelf snapshot.
